  "semantics": [
    "All amounts and all integers remain exact decimal text in the native/operator wire; native ABI encodes i128/u64.",
    "Constructors run atomically at deployment, require selected admin authorization. No open post-deploy initialization.",
    "Only the earliest accepted oracle sample at/after manager maturity and within configured settlement window is eligible; its submission delay was checked by oracle. Historical sample stays valid for later settlement.",
    "Mint current oracle must be fresh. Actual backing price is USDC per underlying token at 7 decimals. All underlying token decimals must be7.",
    "Matched pre-maturity recombination burns amount/amount claims and returns floor(initial_shares*cumulative_recombined/initial_claims)-previous_returned; full recombination returns all original shares.",
    "Settlement withdraws all remaining SY to manager and measures actual token balance increase, then fixes capped PT budget and residual YT budget. Claims from distinct issue IDs never pool.",
    "Each side's partial payout is floor(budget*cumulative_redeemed/settlement_claims)-already_paid, so complete redemption exactly exhausts fixed budget.",
    "rounding_numerator is the non-spendable exact division remainder for nominal PT conversion, not a second funded reserve or extra promise.",
    "A no-op/replay simulation is not a provider transaction. Invocation plans keep exact selected contract/network/source/API bytes.",
    "Underlying arriving while wrapper supply iszero is recorded as unowned reserve on next deposit; it is excluded from share backing and has no withdrawal authority. This prevents donation capture and zero-supply donation denial of service.",
    "Recorded unowned reserve has priority over share backing under a token balance loss: effective reserve=min(actual balance,recorded reserve), share backing=max(actual-recorded reserve,0). A zero-backed share withdrawal with minimum0 is permitted to record actual full loss; a deficit against already frozen Manager liabilities blocks redistribution."
  ],
  "units": {
    "claims": "USDC accounting atoms,7decimals",
    "principal_shortfall": "USDC accounting atoms,7decimals",
    "pt_budget": "underlying token atoms,7decimals",
    "yt_budget": "underlying token atoms,7decimals",
    "backing_underlying": "underlying token atoms,7decimals",
    "rounding_numerator": "remainder of remaining_claims*SCALE divided by final price; not spendable assets"
  }
